Steps I used to install SASS

1. (Linux - optional) Install nvm:
   curl -o- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvm-sh/nvm/v0.39.7/install.sh | bash
   exit
   Re-open terminal, then install Node 20.16 and use it:
   nvm install 20.16
   nvm use 20.16

2. Install SASS using npm (with Node installed):
   npm install sass@3.7.4

Notes:
- On some systems you may prefer a global install: `npm install -g sass`.
- On Windows, install Node (from nodejs.org) then run the `npm install` command above.
